# Prettier's MDX parser merges a heading into the preceding paragraph
# when it directly follows a self-closing JSX tag, even with a blank
# line between them in the source. That blank line is required for
# Mintlify to render the heading and the JSX block as separate
# elements, so this file is hand-formatted and excluded here rather
# than left to silently break on the next `prettier --write`.
docs/site/handbook/download.mdx
